        "Description": "Good Morning, Agent 47.\r\rYour target is 54 year old Raymond Bissett. Bissett currently works at Milton-Fitzpatrick Bank in New York. During his multi-year employement there, he has stolen thousands of dollars and pages of classified documents.\r\rMIlton-Fitzpatrick&apos;s security team has caught Bissett multiple times, but each time the guards suspiciously say nothing happened, then quietly leave the job with an unaccounted profit of $50,000.\r\rThe CEO has now asked us to eliminate Bissett. Good Luck.",
